WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.340
Bath time.

2
00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.270
A toddler spots the cat
in the doorway, points,

3
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.050
and shouts: tat!

4
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.080
Her mum says it back properly: cat.

5
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:13.070
The toddler beams, points
again, and says: tat.

6
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.380
So is she just getting it wrong?

7
00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:18.170
Or is something more organised going on?

8
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.270
Mistake, or system?

9
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.250
In this mission, you'll follow children
from cooing and babbling all the way to

10
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.930
full sentences.

11
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:30.700
You'll ask a sharper question: can she
hear a difference she can't yet say?

12
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.060
And you'll comb through an invented
bath-time conversation for clues.

13
00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:39.490
Your mission: decide whether
'tat' is a mistake or a system.
